$8r + 8g = 8(\frac{25}{18}) + 8(\frac{13}{9})$
$= \frac{200}{18} + \frac{104}{9}$
$= \frac{200}{18} + \frac{208}{18}$
$= \frac{408}{18}$
$= \frac{68}{3}$

So, the weight of $8$ red and $8$ green balls together is $\boxed{\frac{68}{3}}$ pounds.

